{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-heat-adjoint-kernel-symmetry-closed","title":"lem:chow-iii-heat-adjoint-kernel-symmetry-closed","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics.md","line":29,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics.tex#lem:chow-iii-heat-adjoint-kernel-symmetry-closed","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-duhamel-evolving-closed]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics.tex","label":"lem:chow-iii-heat-adjoint-kernel-symmetry-closed","line":59,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Symmetry of heat and adjoint heat kernels]\n\\label{lem:chow-iii-heat-adjoint-kernel-symmetry-closed}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0357}\n\\uses{lem:chow-iii-duhamel-evolving-closed, thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel}\n\\dcref{ch26:26.3}\n\\group{Evolving Heat Kernels}\n\n\nOn a closed manifold, for \\(0\\le \\rho<v\\le T\\),\n\\[\n H(y,v;z,\\rho)=H^*(z,\\rho;y,v).\n\\]\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch Apply Duhamel's identity to \\(H(\\cdot,\\tau;z,\\rho)\\) and\n\\(H^*(\\cdot,\\tau;y,v)\\), then let the two intermediate times tend to\n\\(\\rho\\) and \\(v\\).\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Symmetry of heat and adjoint heat kernels] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a63686f772d6969692d686561742d61646a6f696e742d6b65726e656c2d73796d6d657472792d636c6f736564\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0357</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics%23lem%3Achow-iii-duhamel-evolving-closed\">↗ lem:chow-iii-duhamel-evolving-closed</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23thm%3Achow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel\">↗ thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch26:26.3</span></span>\\group Evolving Heat Kernels <p></p>On a closed manifold, for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0\\le \\rho &lt;v\\le T$\">$0\\le \\rho &lt;v\\le T$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  H(y,v;z,\\rho )=H^*(z,\\rho ;y,v).  \\]\">\\[  H(y,v;z,\\rho )=H^*(z,\\rho ;y,v).  \\]</span>  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Apply Duhamel’s identity to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$H(\\cdot ,\\tau ;z,\\rho )$\">$H(\\cdot ,\\tau ;z,\\rho )$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$H^*(\\cdot ,\\tau ;y,v)$\">$H^*(\\cdot ,\\tau ;y,v)$</span>, then let the two intermediate times tend to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\rho $\">$\\rho $</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v$\">$v$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group、sketch"]},"previous":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics#clm:chow-iii-duhamel-dirichlet-exercise","next":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch26-heat-kernel-bounds-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-heat-kerne